    "intro_html":  "Beef pares is Manila street food at its most honest: chunks of beef braised until they surrender, a sweet and salty soy braise thickened into sauce, and garlic fried rice underneath catching all of it. This is a long, lazy cook, which is exactly what you want on a Sunday. Each bowl carries \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and {{cal}} calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
